# Force binary handling for all image and binary asset types.
# Prevents git from corrupting binary files via autocrlf or
# diff heuristics between commit and checkout on CI runners.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.so binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
